# Anchored to the repository root on purpose. Without the leading slash this
# matches a directory named "investigations" at any depth, which silently
# included frontend/src/features/investigations/ — the two files already there
# survived only because they were tracked before the rule existed, and any new
# file added beside them would have been ignored without a word.
/investigations/
